tion\":73},\"The 10 Creative \\nCommandments Pt. 1\",[],\"2025-01-15\",{\"dimensions\":2883,\"alt\":2886,\"copyright\":6,\"url\":2887,\"id\":2888,\"edit\":2889,\"desktop\":2890,\"portrait\":2897,\"mobile\":2902},{\"width\":2884,\"height\":2885},1151,1166,\"Photo with quotation\",\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fstudio-karo\\u002FaCsHgydWJ-7kSSYp_blog-1.jpg?auto=format,compress\",\"aCsHgydWJ-7kSSYp\",{\"x\":25,\"y\":25,\"zoom\":26,\"background\":27},{\"dimensions\":2891,\"alt\":6,\"copyright\":6,\"url\":2894,\"id\":2888,\"edit\":2895},{\"width\":2892,\"height\":2893},1070,865,\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fstudio-karo\\u002FaCsHgydWJ-7kSSYp_blog-1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C0%2C1151%2C930&w=1070&h=865\",{\"x\":25,\"y\":25,\"zoom\":2896,\"background\":27},1.0000000000000002,{\"dimensions\":2898,\"alt\":6,\"copyright\":6,\"url\":2900,\"id\":2888,\"edit\":2901},{\"width\":291,\"height\":2899},1625,\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fstudio-karo\\u002FaCsHgydWJ-7kSSYp_blog-1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C13%2C1151%2C1140&w=1640&h=1625\",{\"x\":25,\"y\":2149,\"zoom\":26,\"background\":27},{\"dimensions\":2903,\"alt\":6,\"copyright\":6,\"url\":2905,\"id\":2888,\"edit\":2906},{\"width\":1735,\"height\":2904},635,\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fstudio-karo\\u002FaCsHgydWJ-7kSSYp_blog-1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C12%2C1151%2C1142&w=640&h=635\",{\"x\":25,\"y\":2907,\"zoom\":26,\"background\":27},12,\"according to KARO\",[2910],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2911,\"spans\":2912,\"direction\":73},\"A Deeper Dive\",[],\"Read now\",\"Close\",\"article_text$ea273f92-9cee-4b8d-a8fa-b721a714dfa6\",\"article_text\",{\"variation\":64,\"version\":65,\"items\":2918,\"primary\":2919,\"id\":3032,\"slice_type\":3033,\"slice_label\":6},[],{\"paragraphs\":2920},[2921,2933,2948,2963,2981,2996,3023],{\"title\":2922,\"text\":2923},[],[2924,2927,2930],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2925,\"spans\":2926,\"direction\":73},\"Recently I posted a video about my personal 10 Creative Commandments – 1 year post-quitting my job to be a creative full-time.\",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2928,\"spans\":2929,\"direction\":73},\"It was nearly impossible to expand on any of my points in just 60 seconds, but I'm so happy that even a short summary seemed to help a lot of you guys. It's crazy I was soooo close to not even posting it, and now the comments on that video have single-handedly reminded me why I do what I do!!! \",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2931,\"spans\":2932,\"direction\":73},\"So let's get into it  ˶ᵔ ᵕ ᵔ˶\",[],{\"title\":2934,\"text\":2938},[2935],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2936,\"spans\":2937,\"direction\":73},\"1. Start before you're ready.\",[],[2939,2942,2945],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2940,\"spans\":2941,\"direction\":73},\"The biggest realization I've had is that 1. no one knows what they are doing and 2. you'll never be \\\"perfectly\\\" ready. It's a myth and self limiting belief that will keep you standing still. It will keep you feeling like \\\"if I could just get one more ____ before starting that piece\\u002Fquitting that job\\u002Fposting that video THEN I'll be ready\\\". STOPPP\",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2943,\"spans\":2944,\"direction\":73},\"Banish that thinking!!! A quote that really hit me hard as I was preparing to quit last January is \\\"leap, and the net will appear\\\". It might seem cheesy – but it replays in my head constantly to this day (especially yesterday as I nervously signed the lease to a new studio!!).\",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2946,\"spans\":2947,\"direction\":73},\"I feel that the universe won't present you with the opportunities you seek unless you place yourself in the right channel. Which takes a mix of mindset, environment, and action.\",[],{\"title\":2949,\"text\":2953},[2950],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2951,\"spans\":2952,\"direction\":73},\"2. Get it or get out •ᴗ•\",[],[2954,2957,2960],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2955,\"spans\":2956,\"direction\":73},\"VERY IMPORTANT ‼️ Only surround yourself with people who get it. I'm sooo serious. This will singlehandedly change your life. That whole thing about you being a sum of your five closest people is so true. And most of the times, it just one person to really \\\"get\\\" you.\",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2958,\"spans\":2959,\"direction\":73},\"Cut off anyone that makes you feel weird, or too much, or \\\"cringe\\\". I promise you that by doing that, you're opening yourself up to a world of people that get it. Putting yourself out there expedites this process. Put yourself in places you want to be! I've met some of the most inspirational and cool friends at gallery openings I've shown up to alone when I first moved to NYC. \",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2961,\"spans\":2962,\"direction\":73},\"Someone not \\\"getting you\\\" or your art, is a them problem. Don't make it your problem, just focus on yourself.\",[],{\"title\":2964,\"text\":2968},[2965],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2966,\"spans\":2967,\"direction\":73},\"3. Your life is art\",[],[2969,2972,2975,2978],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2970,\"spans\":2971,\"direction\":73},\"Maybe it is just because I like to romanticize everything, but this one really changed my life artistically. Affirm to yourself that you are art and an extension of your art. It's a huge perspective shift I have had this year, zooming out and seeing my life as a character in my greater storyline.\",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2973,\"spans\":2974,\"direction\":73},\"Also, this is why I started letting my collections take over my life. In the form of what I wear, listen to, focus on, etc.\",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2976,\"spans\":2977,\"direction\":73},\"I've said it before, but in case you are just finding me, it has made me more present than ever before. It opens me to new side quests and trying new things all in the spirit of the art. This red piece was draaama, sultry, and bold and I do say I think I have done a great job of living these things in my personal life. Only some of it I document for the internet.\",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2979,\"spans\":2980,\"direction\":73},\"Historically, \\\"important\\\" art becomes important because of who is behind it, and their story, and the context in which it was created. So tell your story, stop being shy!!! hehe\",[],{\"title\":2982,\"text\":2986},[2983],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2984,\"spans\":2985,\"direction\":73},\"4. Heal \\u002F feed your inner child\",[],[2987,2990,2993],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2988,\"spans\":2989,\"direction\":73},\"I think this is also just generally a quest we all face as adults. But in the past year, I have felt like I have brought my inner child back to life. Consciously allowing myself to be whimsical and do things I was afraid to do, not just as a kid, but as a teen and even in college. A great way to do this is taught in The Artist's Way by Julia Cameron – artist dates.\\u2028\",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2991,\"spans\":2992,\"direction\":73},\"These look like committing to yourself that at least once a week, you will do something creative with yourself. Tomorrow, I'm going to try ceramics for the first time as my date.\\u2028\",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2994,\"spans\":2995,\"direction\":73},\"I don't plan on ever doing anything professionally with ceramics, which makes it even better. Last week I found an archery range at a warehouse in Brooklyn. I felt like a kid again. It made me so happy it literally inspired me. You get it.\",[],{\"title\":2997,\"text\":3001},[2998],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2999,\"spans\":3000,\"direction\":73},\"5. Question Everything\",[],[3002,3005,3008,3011,3014,3017,3020],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3003,\"spans\":3004,\"direction\":73},\"I felt like so much of my past year was about unlearning \\\"rules\\\" and self-limiting beliefs and questioning why they exist in the first place. Honestly, therapy was a huge driver in this. I finally found a quality therapist a year ago who helped me question everything. Questioning everything (internally and externally) is soo simple yet SOOO powerful. \",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3006,\"spans\":3007,\"direction\":73},\"This has helped me so much. I remember one of the first instances when this clicked for me – I hated how the 11:11 piece looked as a print. I thought it looked good as the original, but so ugly as a print.\\u2028\",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3009,\"spans\":3010,\"direction\":73},\"At the time, prints were the only thing I sold other than the piece itself, so it was important for my income. I felt like a failure (?lol dramatic) and a bad artist and I was so frustrated because I felt \\\"forced\\\" to release it as it was, because a print has to be an exact copy of the original, because that's how it always is. right..? \",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3012,\"spans\":3013,\"direction\":73},\"Ok, according to which rules.. why?\\u2028\\u2028\",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3015,\"spans\":3016,\"direction\":73},\"There's no rules (!!!) I wanted to create a version with additional framing, typography, and color gradients, and make the print-version of the piece look different than the actual piece. So I did, and I felt a million times better.\\u2028\",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3018,\"spans\":3019,\"direction\":73},\"And I know it sounds so small, but it helped me identify that subconscious \\\"voice\\\" in my head, that we normally don't even question. If you don't start becoming suspicious of that \\\"voice\\\" (everyone has one), then those limiting subconscious thoughts can lead to holding you back in much bigger ways. \",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3021,\"spans\":3022,\"direction\":73},\"This is getting long and emails can be a lot to digest.\",[],{\"title\":3024,\"text\":3028},[3025],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3026,\"spans\":3027,\"direction\":73},\"Sending Part 2 next Wednesday morning.  •ᴗ•\",[],[3029],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3030,\"spans\":3031,\"direction\":73},\"I haven't written long form before on my platform and I would love to know if you like it or any suggestions. DM me or send message via contact form on my website. ❤️\",[],\"article_hero$72b05d2f-facf-4d42-ba66-a65c20749249\",\"article_hero\",\"The 10 Creative Commandments Pt. 1 | Karo\",\"It was nearly impossible to expand on any of my points in just 60 seconds, but I'm so happy that even a short summary seemed to help a lot of you guys. It's crazy I was soooo close to not even posting it, and now the comments on that video have single-handedly reminded me why I do what I do!!!\",{\"dimensions\":3037,\"alt\":6,\"copyright\":6,\"url\":2855,\"id\":2856,\"edit\":3038},{\"width\":2853,\"height\":2854},{\"x\":2858,\"y\":25,\"zoom\":26,\"background\":27},{\"id\":3040,\"uid\":3041,\"url\":3042,\"type\":2864,\"href\":3043,\"tags\":3044,\"first_publication_date\":3045,\"last_publication_date\":3046,\"slugs\":3047,\"linked_documents\":3048,\"lang\":14,\"alternate_languages\":3049,\"data\":3050},\"aCsJaxEAACQAqCJ9\",\"the-creative-commandments-pt.-2\",\"\\u002Fblog\\u002Fthe-creative-commandments-pt.-2\",\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fstudio-karo.cdn.prismic.io\\u002Fapi\\u002Fv2\\u002Fdocuments\\u002Fsearch?ref=aUj6KBIAAFrul_TJ&q=%5B%5B%3Ad+%3D+at%28document.id%2C+%22aCsJaxEAACQAqCJ9%22%29+%5D%5D\",[],\"2025-05-19T10:35:25+0000\",\"2025-07-29T14:25:46+0000\",[3041],[],[],{\"slices\":3051,\"meta_title\":3172,\"meta_description\":3173,\"meta_image\":3174},[3052,3083],{\"variation\":64,\"version\":65,\"items\":3053,\"primary\":3054,\"id\":3082,\"slice_type\":2916,\"slice_label\":6},[],{\"title\":3055,\"date\":3059,\"image\":3060,\"info_subtitle\":2908,\"subtitle\":3079,\"read_button_text\":2913,\"close_button_text\":2914},[3056],{\"type\":955,\"text\":3057,\"spans\":3058,\"direction\":73},\"the creative \\ncommandments pt. 2\",[],\"2025-03-15\",{\"dimensions\":3061,\"alt\":3062,\"copyright\":6,\"url\":3063,\"id\":3064,\"edit\":3065,\"desktop\":3066,\"portrait\":3071,\"mobile\":3075},{\"width\":2884,\"height\":2885},\"Book with quotation\",\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fstudio-karo\\u002FaCsI6SdWJ-7kSSct_blog-2.jpg?auto=format,compress\",\"aCsI6SdWJ-7kSSct\",{\"x\":25,\"y\":25,\"zoom\":26,\"background\":27},{\"dimensions\":3067,\"alt\":6,\"copyright\":6,\"url\":3068,\"id\":3064,\"edit\":3069},{\"width\":2892,\"height\":2893},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fstudio-karo\\u002FaCsI6SdWJ-7kSSct_blog-2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C113%2C1151%2C930&w=1070&h=865\",{\"x\":25,\"y\":3070,\"zoom\":2896,\"background\":27},113,{\"dimensions\":3072,\"alt\":6,\"copyright\":6,\"url\":3073,\"id\":3064,\"edit\":3074},{\"width\":291,\"height\":2899},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fstudio-karo\\u002FaCsI6SdWJ-7kSSct_blog-2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C13%2C1151%2C1140&w=1640&h=1625\",{\"x\":25,\"y\":2149,\"zoom\":26,\"background\":27},{\"dimensions\":3076,\"alt\":6,\"copyright\":6,\"url\":3077,\"id\":3064,\"edit\":3078},{\"width\":1735,\"height\":2904},\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fimages.prismic.io\\u002Fstudio-karo\\u002FaCsI6SdWJ-7kSSct_blog-2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C12%2C1151%2C1142&w=640&h=635\",{\"x\":25,\"y\":2907,\"zoom\":26,\"background\":27},[3080],{\"type\":70,\"text\":2911,\"spans\":3081,\"direction\":73},[],\"article_text$e0c49807-300e-45f7-ae9d-0d23b4c548a2\",{\"variation\":64,\"version\":65,\"items\":3084,\"primary\":3085,\"id\":3171,\"slice_type\":3033,\"slice_label\":6},[],{\"paragraphs\":3086},[3087,3099,3111,3123,3138,3153,3165],{\"title\":3088,\"text\":3089},[],[3090,3093,3096],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3091,\"spans\":3092,\"direction\":73},\"A few months ago I posted a video about my personal 10 creative commandments – 1 year after quitting my job to be a creative full-time. \",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3094,\"spans\":3095,\"direction\":73},\"Containing everything into under 60 seconds was hard as a girl that loves to yap. So I sent over a part 1 deeper dive, and now here is the part 2 of that. You can read part 1 here. \",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3097,\"spans\":3098,\"direction\":73},\"Let's get into it. ˶ᵔ ᵕ ᵔ˶\",[],{\"title\":3100,\"text\":3104},[3101],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3102,\"spans\":3103,\"direction\":73},\"6. Scheme ✮⋆˙\",[],[3105,3108],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3106,\"spans\":3107,\"direction\":73},\"Scheming is your precious solo time in which you let yourself think big. Like really uncomfortably big – take your idea and imagine it leveled up. Then level it up again as an exercise to push the limits of your mind. Now, equally as important – you need to start planning how you're going to pull it off. Break it down into tiny, bite size pieces. What tiny action can you do today to bring you closer? I promise there is something. Reaching out to a potential collaborator? Mocking up a design? Searching for a production space on Peerspace for 20 mins?\\u2028\",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3109,\"spans\":3110,\"direction\":73},\"I cannot stress enough how important it is to sit with yourself and just think. No distractions. I know music can help the creative brainstorming process, but I also encourage sitting with yourself and your thoughts in silence and it can be all the more powerful. \",[],{\"title\":3112,\"text\":3116},[3113],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3114,\"spans\":3115,\"direction\":73},\"7. Let go & let flow\",[],[3117,3120],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3118,\"spans\":3119,\"direction\":73},\"Let your art take shape of it's own and don't force things. I think sometimes as artists we can get married to the \\\"end goal\\\" of how we want our work to look like. The ideal image of a final product before we have even started creating it.\",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3121,\"spans\":3122,\"direction\":73},\"This is a trap - it can limit you from beautiful alternate outcomes, and ultimately bring you into frustration if the smallest detail goes awry. When you let go and open your channel, you allow for flow – the magical state that will make you fall in love with the process vs. the final product. \",[],{\"title\":3124,\"text\":3128},[3125],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3126,\"spans\":3127,\"direction\":73},\"8. you = your bff\",[],[3129,3132,3135],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3130,\"spans\":3131,\"direction\":73},\"Talk to yourself more!!!! You should be your own best friend. Humans, especially artists, can have a terrible habit of bullying oneself. Putting yourself and your creations out there is a grand act of courage, and can feel absolutely mortifying at times.\",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3133,\"spans\":3134,\"direction\":73},\"The vulnerability that is required... the doubts... the insecurities... often lead us to self-sabotaging as a result of fear and uncertainty. I still fall victim to this sometimes – but slowly over time, the kinder and gentler you are on yourself, your brain will start to catch up and rewire. I promise! Remember your inner artist is like a kid – so be gentle! and loving! and nurturing!\\u2028\",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3136,\"spans\":3137,\"direction\":73},\"Practice talking to yourself (out loud!!!) like you're encouraging your own best friend. \",[],{\"title\":3139,\"text\":3143},[3140],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3141,\"spans\":3142,\"direction\":73},\"9. Take risks \",[],[3144,3147,3150],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3145,\"spans\":3146,\"direction\":73},\"I knowwwww it sounds cliché but it's true. I'm obsessed with the phrase leap, and the net will appear. The phrase and the sentiment has changed my life. First, you need to get yourself in a position where you trust yourself.\\u2028\\u2028\",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3148,\"spans\":3149,\"direction\":73},\"When you start to take risks \\u002F leap \\u002F put yourself out there – people and opportunities will present themselves. There's no other way around it. You have to leap first.\\u2028\\u2028\",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3151,\"spans\":3152,\"direction\":73},\"Practice first with baby steps – show up to the gallery opening you're interested in alone. Talk to one person. Post your first video online. Buy a ceramic studio membership. Soon it all feels more and more attainable. \",[],{\"title\":3154,\"text\":3158},[3155],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3156,\"spans\":3157,\"direction\":73},\"10. Celebrate wins\",[],[3159,3162],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3160,\"spans\":3161,\"direction\":73},\"This one is slept on. Especially if you work for yourself, as many creatives do. The creative path is the path less traveled and it's often the lonelier path. If you don't make way for joy, self-care, celebrations, friends, etc., it may not show up at your door as it would on a traditional life path.\",[],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3163,\"spans\":3164,\"direction\":73},\"I don't like the tortured artist stereotype that some associate with being a \\\"true\\\" artist – try following joy, see where it leads you. This is tied to the quest of reconnecting with your inner child. \",[],{\"title\":3166,\"text\":3170},[3167],{\"type\":70,\"text\":3168,\"spans\":3169,\"direction\":73},\"That's all for now •ᴗ•\",[],[],\"article_hero$2ed72cd1-4e22-49b7-95da-377dc113f018\",\"the creative commandments pt. 2 | Karo\",\"Containing everything into under 60 seconds was hard as a girl that loves to yap. So I sent over a part 1 deeper dive, and now here is the part 2 of that. You can read part 1 here.\",{\"dimensions\":3175,\"alt\":6,\"copyright\":6,\"url\":2855,\"id\":2856,\"edit\":3176},{\"width\":2853,\"height\":2854},{\"x\":2858,\"y\":25,\"zoom\":26,\"background\":27},[\"Reactive\",3178],{\"$scart\":3179},{\"exists\":39,\"loading\":39,\"ready\":39},[\"Set\"],[\"ShallowReactive\",3182],{\"global\":6,\"page-karoverse\":6,\"articles\":6}]</script></body></html>"
          },
